[19.142,"o","Usage: nuvira tools [options] [command]\r\n\r\nInspect the agent tool registry (pipeline + experience tools)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help          display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  list                List every registered tool (the H1 tool-calling surface)\r\n  show <name>         Show a tool's description and input schema\r\n  toolsets [options]  List toolset groups (capability gating) with enabled\r\n                      state; enable/disable a group\r\n  help [command]      display help for command\r\n"]
