[20.909,"o","Usage: nuvira plugins [options] [command]\r\n\r\nManage provider plugins, agent plugins, and workflow templates\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help      display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  list            List all discovered plugins and workflows\r\n  scan            Force re-scan all plugin directories\r\n  help [command]  display help for command\r\n"]
