[38.313,"o","Usage: nuvira dashboard [options] [command]\r\n\r\nLaunch the web-based dashboard for visualizing agent execution and system\r\nstatus\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -p, --port <port>      Port to listen on (default: 3030)\r\n  --host <host>          Host to bind to (default: \"127.0.0.1\")\r\n  --no-open              Do not auto-open the browser\r\n  --build                Build the dashboard (npm run build:dashboard) before\r\n                         starting\r\n  --force                Detect a stale dashboard on the port (API/SSE\r\n                         mismatch) and offer to restart it\r\n  --cwd <dir>            Working directory for the dashboard (default:\r\n                         process.cwd())\r\n  --no-gateway           Do not start the messaging gateway alongside the\r\n                         dashboard\r\n  --keep-gateway         Leave the gateway running after the dashboard exits\r\n  --gateway-port <port>  Webhook receiver port for the gateway (default: 8787)\r\n  -h, --help             display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  stop [options]         Stop a running dashboard gracefully (SIGTERM — from\r\n                         any terminal)\r\n"]
