[42.74,"o","Usage: nuvira publish [options] [goal]\r\n\r\nAutonomous publish workflow — version, build, publish to npm & GitHub\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\n  goal                       Optional publish goal (e.g., \"Release v1.2.0\")\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  --patch                    Patch version bump (default) (default: false)\r\n  --minor                    Minor version bump (default: false)\r\n  --major                    Major version bump (default: false)\r\n  --dry-run                  Preview changes without publishing (default:\r\n                             false)\r\n  --skip-tests               Skip test verification phase (default: false)\r\n  -p, --provider <provider>  Inference provider\r\n  -m, --model <model>        Model override\r\n  -v, --verbose              Show detailed agent output (default: false)\r\n  -h, --help                 display help for command\r\n"]
